1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,419
Track 3.3 Unit 3 Language in use Activity 1
Bài 3.3 Bài 3 Ngôn ngữ thực hành Hoạt động 1

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,359
Listen and circle
Nghe và khoanh tròn

3
00:00:09,919 --> 00:00:13,460
Where were you on Sunday, Greta?
Chủ nhật bạn ở đâu, Greta?

4
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,960
I was at the cafe.
Mình ở quán cà phê.

5
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,359
Who were you with?
Bạn đi với ai?

6
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:23,019
I was with my grandparents and my sister.
Mình đi với ông bà và chị gái mình.

7
00:00:23,019 --> 00:00:25,199
When were you there?
Bạn ở đó khi nào?

8
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:27,920
We were there in the morning.
Chúng mình ở đó vào buổi sáng.

9
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,680
What was the weather like?
Thời tiết thế nào?

10
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:33,880
It was hot and sunny.
Trời nóng và nắng.
